    "body": "### Pre-submission Checklist\n\n- [x] I have searched the existing issues and this bug has not been reported yet\n- [x] I have tested this issue on the [demo site](https://demo.usememos.com) or the latest version\n\n### Where did you encounter this bug?\n\nLatest stable version (self-hosted)\n\n### Memos Version\n\nv0.26.0\n\n### Bug Description\n\n```\nUpdate user: [invalid_argument] rpc error: code = InvalidArgument desc = invalid user name: invalid request \"\"\n```\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Go to <https://demo.usememos.com/setting#member>\n2. Create a member.\n3. Edit the new user, change username or password, save.\n4. You will got the error message.\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n_No response_\n\n### Screenshots & Additional Context\n\n<img width=\"1459\" height=\"654\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/def5847d-f78e-47f9-8b74-34df673b109d\" />",
